# Build context sent to the daemon for EVERY image build.                (review, PR 63)
#
# vendor/ is 2.4 GB and was being shipped to the daemon for all four images even though none
# COPYs from it -- the ros2 image clones Cosys-AirSim at its pinned SHA instead, precisely so a
# fresh clone (where vendor/ does not exist yet) can still build.
vendor/
worlds/
out/
.git/
docs/worklog/html/
*.mcap
*.mp4
